WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.500 --> 00:00:04.000
The ferry leaves at nine.

2
00:00:04.500 --> 00:00:08.000
<i>Tickets are sold on board.</i>

3
00:00:08.500 --> 00:00:13.000
The deck is wet
after the rain.

4
00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:17.500
<i>Mind the step.</i>
Thank you.

5
00:00:18.000 --> 00:00:22.000
Arrival in two hours.
